SYMBOL voltage 1232 160 R0
SYMATTR InstName Vload
SYMATTR Value PULSE({Psleep} {Pactive} 0 0.1m 0.1m {Ton} {Tper})
TEXT 32 8 Left 3 ;Solar PV -> TP4056 charger -> 18650 battery -> load  (24 h, 1 s = 1 h)
TEXT 32 40 Left 2 ;Time axis: 1 second of simulation = 1 hour of a day (t = 0 is midnight, t = 12 is noon).
TEXT 32 68 Left 2 ;Plot V(bat), V(pvo), I(Vichg) (charge current), I(Vild) (load current). Energy integrals in Wh appear in View > SPICE Error Log.
TEXT 32 96 Left 2 ;Battery capacitance is scaled by 1/3600 so currents stay real while hours become seconds.
TEXT 32 560 Left 2 ;Solar panel 6 V / 2 W: photocurrent proportional to irradiance (1.0 = 1000 W/m2)
TEXT 32 588 Left 2 !Bph 0 pv I=0.40*V(irr)
TEXT 32 616 Left 2 !.model DPV D(Is=1n N=14)
TEXT 32 644 Left 2 ;TP4056 linear Li-ion charger: CC 1 A max, CV 4.2 V, needs ~4 V input, no reverse current
TEXT 32 672 Left 2 !Bchg pvo ichg I=min(1.0, max(0,(V(pvo)-V(bat)-0.15)/0.5)) * min(1,max(0,(V(pvo)-3.9)/0.2)) * min(1,max(0,(4.2-V(bat))/0.05))
TEXT 32 700 Left 2 !Vichg ichg bat 0
TEXT 32 728 Left 2 ;System load drawn from battery through boost converter (efficiency 85%)
TEXT 32 756 Left 2 !Vild bat iload 0
TEXT 32 784 Left 2 !Bload iload 0 I=V(pload)/(0.85*max(V(bat),2.5))
TEXT 32 812 Left 2 ;2000 mAh 18650 cell: Q = 7200 C over 3.0-4.2 V -> 6000 F; divided by 3600 because 1 sim-second = 1 hour
TEXT 32 840 Left 2 !.param Cbat=6000/3600
TEXT 32 868 Left 2 ;Load: 30 s measurement + WiFi upload every 5 min at 1.0 W, deep sleep 10 mW otherwise
TEXT 32 896 Left 2 !.param Pactive=1.0 Psleep=0.01 Ton={30/3600} Tper={300/3600}
TEXT 32 924 Left 2 !.ic V(cell)=3.55 V(bat)=3.55
TEXT 32 952 Left 2 ;Power into / out of the battery (W) for the energy integrals
TEXT 32 980 Left 2 !Bpin pin 0 V=V(bat)*I(Vichg)
TEXT 32 1008 Left 2 !Bpout pout 0 V=V(bat)*I(Vild)
TEXT 32 1036 Left 2 !.meas TRAN Wh_harvested INTEG V(pin)
TEXT 32 1064 Left 2 !.meas TRAN Wh_consumed INTEG V(pout)
TEXT 32 1092 Left 2 !.meas TRAN Vbat_start FIND V(bat) AT=0.01
TEXT 32 1120 Left 2 !.meas TRAN Vbat_end FIND V(bat) AT=24
TEXT 32 1148 Left 2 !.meas TRAN Vbat_max MAX V(bat)
TEXT 32 1176 Left 2 !.tran 1m 24 0 2m uic
